{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54892","headline":"兵要望江南 占水族第二十一（京本列第十二○七首） 五 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占水族第二十一（京本列第十二○七首） 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"城营内，龟蟹入其（京本作「营」）中。\n更有聚蝇亿万数，军兵溃散（京本作「败」）败不从容，看即弃（辛本、川本作「旋」）营空。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54892.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54892","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}